{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"2eeae912f6e046fba61691278847e8ec","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"71ed7110ac939a4d3aa95b6ad00a5271cfe2","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=71ed7110ac939a4d3aa95b6ad00a5271cfe2","view_num":1412,"pub_timestamp":"1704697046","title":"1월 11일 업데이트 사전 공지","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=71ed7110ac939a4d3aa95b6ad00a5271cfe2","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"b637aefe66db6fcb28436be738e3b9f1\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e존경하는\u0026nbsp;지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e오래\u0026nbsp;기다려\u0026nbsp;주셔서\u0026nbsp;진심으로\u0026nbsp;감사드립니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검이\u0026nbsp;완료되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함에서\u0026nbsp;확인해\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이번\u0026nbsp;업데이트는\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;클라이언트가\u0026nbsp;업데이트되어\u0026nbsp;스토어에서\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;클라이언트를\u0026nbsp;새로\u0026nbsp;다운로드하셔야만\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;다운로드를\u0026nbsp;위해,\u0026nbsp;디바이스의\u0026nbsp;저장\u0026nbsp;공간은\u0026nbsp;최소\u0026nbsp;5GB\u0026nbsp;이상\u0026nbsp;확보해\u0026nbsp;주시기를\u0026nbsp;권장드립니다.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전의\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;Launcher에서\u0026nbsp;[게임\u0026nbsp;시작]\u0026nbsp;버튼을\u0026nbsp;터치하면\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;클라이언트로\u0026nbsp;업데이트가\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[리소스\u0026nbsp;파일\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;과정에서\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하는\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;리소스\u0026nbsp;다운로드에\u0026nbsp;실패할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있사오니,\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하지\u0026nbsp;말아\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e업데이트\u0026nbsp;주요\u0026nbsp;내용:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.1\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[레오나]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e맹수를\u0026nbsp;다루는\u0026nbsp;해피\u0026nbsp;주의\u0026nbsp;큰\u0026nbsp;언니,\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[레오나]가\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e레오나는\u0026nbsp;SG를\u0026nbsp;사용하는\u0026nbsp;아군\u0026nbsp;지원에\u0026nbsp;특화된\u0026nbsp;니케입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eSG를\u0026nbsp;사용하는\u0026nbsp;아군의\u0026nbsp;적정\u0026nbsp;사거리를\u0026nbsp;증가시켜\u0026nbsp;주며,\u0026nbsp;공격능력을\u0026nbsp;더욱\u0026nbsp;강화시켜\u0026nbsp;줍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;지원형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;라이언\u0026nbsp;로어(SG)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;수냉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;테트라\u0026nbsp;라인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[레오나]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;[레오나]를\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;업데이트를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;[레오나]는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.1\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;LION\u0026nbsp;HEART\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e맹수를\u0026nbsp;방주에서\u0026nbsp;보호하고\u0026nbsp;있다는\u0026nbsp;것에\u0026nbsp;불안감을\u0026nbsp;표출하는\u0026nbsp;시민들.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e그로\u0026nbsp;인해\u0026nbsp;보호소는\u0026nbsp;임시로\u0026nbsp;문을\u0026nbsp;닫게\u0026nbsp;된다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e문을\u0026nbsp;닫은\u0026nbsp;김에\u0026nbsp;한\u0026nbsp;번도\u0026nbsp;다\u0026nbsp;같이\u0026nbsp;쉬어본\u0026nbsp;적이\u0026nbsp;없는\u0026nbsp;해피\u0026nbsp;주\u0026nbsp;스쿼드는,\u0026nbsp;여유로운\u0026nbsp;하루를\u0026nbsp;보내게\u0026nbsp;되는데….\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eLION\u0026nbsp;HEART\u0026nbsp;이벤트에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;획득하고\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;다양한\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점의\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;교환은\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;종료됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지]가\u0026nbsp;LION\u0026nbsp;HEART에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;도전하여\u0026nbsp;각종\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득해\u0026nbsp;보세요!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.2\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;Days\u0026nbsp;Login\u0026nbsp;이벤트-WHITE\u0026nbsp;LION\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;매일\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하여\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;7일까지\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;로그인\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;CHERRY\u0026nbsp;BLOSSOM\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;CHERRY\u0026nbsp;BLOSSOM이\u0026nbsp;아카이브에\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;LION\u0026nbsp;HEART에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트를\u0026nbsp;해금할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;[메모리\u0026nbsp;필름]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e지휘관\u0026nbsp;5명이\u0026nbsp;협동하여\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;[니힐리스타\u0026nbsp;[H.S.T.A.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;도전합니다.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전은\u0026nbsp;친구나\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버\u0026nbsp;혹은\u0026nbsp;자동\u0026nbsp;매칭을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;도전이\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;처치하여\u0026nbsp;획득한\u0026nbsp;부서진\u0026nbsp;코어는\u0026nbsp;고철\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;쥬얼,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;12일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;14일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;참여\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드는\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;19일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버들과\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;보스에\u0026nbsp;도전하세요.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;칩을\u0026nbsp;모으면\u0026nbsp;풍부한\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;19일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*참여\u0026nbsp;조건:\u0026nbsp;소속\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레벨\u0026nbsp;3\u0026nbsp;달성\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유의\u0026nbsp;사항:\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u0026nbsp;시즌\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;탈퇴\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;구성원\u0026nbsp;추방을\u0026nbsp;할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.1\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;패키지가\u0026nbsp;갱신됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*판매\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;～\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;25일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e상세한\u0026nbsp;정보는\u0026nbsp;[로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;패키지]에서\u0026nbsp;확인하여\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸-오버클럭\u0026nbsp;모드\u0026nbsp;(Beta\u0026nbsp;시즌)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e새롭게\u0026nbsp;개방되는\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸-오버클럭\u0026nbsp;모드에서는(Beta시즌)\u0026nbsp;추가\u0026nbsp;옵션을\u0026nbsp;설정하여\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;새로운\u0026nbsp;환경에\u0026nbsp;도전하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;오버클럭을\u0026nbsp;클리어하면,\u0026nbsp;최고\u0026nbsp;코어\u0026nbsp;배수에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;대응되는\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;매뉴얼,\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;매뉴얼을\u0026nbsp;최초\u0026nbsp;1회\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(만약,\u0026nbsp;기존\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;5\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;C까지의\u0026nbsp;보상이\u0026nbsp;남아있다면,\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*참여\u0026nbsp;조건:\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;5\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;C\u0026nbsp;클리어\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;16일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;30일\u0026nbsp;4:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;참여\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;방주\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e개선\u0026nbsp;사항\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;기타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.1\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;도감에\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터와\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;미리\u0026nbsp;보기가\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;코스튬은\u0026nbsp;추후\u0026nbsp;출시될\u0026nbsp;예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.2\u0026nbsp;알려진\u0026nbsp;이슈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸\u0026nbsp;튜토리얼\u0026nbsp;진행시\u0026nbsp;난이도\u0026nbsp;목록이\u0026nbsp;일시적으로\u0026nbsp;어색하게\u0026nbsp;보이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;입장\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e③NEW\u0026nbsp;YEAR,\u0026nbsp;NEW\u0026nbsp;SWORD\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;재화\u0026nbsp;환급\u0026nbsp;메일에\u0026nbsp;재화\u0026nbsp;이름이\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;표기된\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.3\u0026nbsp;기타\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선\u0026nbsp;상황\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;버그\u0026nbsp;복구\u0026nbsp;상황은\u0026nbsp;시스템\u0026nbsp;공지\u0026nbsp;[1월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;개선사항]에서\u0026nbsp;안내하여\u0026nbsp;드리겠습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e감사합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e《승리의\u0026nbsp;여신:\u0026nbsp;니케》\u0026nbsp;운영진\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_8951186a47a91db81005714104461b9ed62a9b28-1920x1080-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"1월 11일 업데이트 사전 공지","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"존경하는 지휘관님,\n \n오래 기다려 주셔서 진심으로 감사드립니다. 서버 점검이 완료되었습니다. 서버 점검 보상은 게임 내 메일함에서 확인해 주시기 바랍니다. \n \n이번 업데이트는 게임 클라이언트가 업데이트되어 스토어에서 최신 버전 클라이언트를 새로 다운로드하셔야만 게임에 접속하실 수 있습니다. 신규 클라이언트 다운로드를 위해, 디바이스의 저장 공간은 최소 5GB 이상 확보해 주시기를 권장드립니다. PC 버전의 경우, Launcher에서 [게임 시작] 버튼을 터치하면 최신 클라이언트로 업데이트가 진행됩니다.\n[리소스 파일 다운로드 과정에서 게임 앱을 강제 종료하는 경우 클라이언트 리소스 다운로드에 실패할 수 있사오니, 다운로드 중엔 게임 앱을 강제 종료하지 말아 주시기 바랍니다.]\n \n업데이트 주요 내용:\n1. 신규 캐릭터\n1.1 SSR 니케 [레오나]\n맹수를 다루는 해피 주의 큰 언니, SSR 니케 [레오나]가 특수 모집에 합류합니다. \n레오나는 SG를 사용하는 아군 지원에 특화된 ","language":"ko","father_content_id":"71ed7110ac939a4d3aa95b6ad00a5271cfe2","result":0}}